  "zai": {
    "capturedAt": "2026-10-09",
    "source": "Z.ai official pricing page (docs.z.ai/guides/overview/pricing): the only models priced $0 for input, cached input and output",
    "freeModels": [
      "glm-4.7-flash",
      "glm-4.5-flash",
      "glm-4.6v-flash"
    ],
    "listNote": "Z.ai's /models list does NOT include the free flash models, yet they work: probed 2026-10-09, glm-4.7-flash and glm-4.5-flash answer HTTP 200 while every other listed model (glm-5.3, glm-5.3-flash, glm-5.3-flashx, glm-5.2, glm-5.1, glm-5, glm-5-turbo, glm-4.7, glm-4.6, glm-4.5, glm-4.5-air, glm-4.7-flashx, glm-4.5-airx, glm-4.5-x) answers HTTP 429 code 1113 'Insufficient balance or no resource package'. So the free list above, not /models, is what says a Z.ai model is free. glm-4.6v-flash (the free VISION model) was confirmed working on 2026-10-10 as well."
  }
